hadiths[69]{hadithnumber,text}:
"633","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey paas merey Rab ki taraf se aaney wala aaya aur us ne mujhey khabar di ya farmaya: Khushkhabri di, ke beshak jo meri ummat mein se mara jabke wo Allah key sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta tha wo Jannat mein daakhil hoga. Main ne kaha: Agarchey us ne zina kya aur agarchey us ne chori ki? Aap ne farmaya: Agarchey us ne zina kya aur agarchey us ne chori ki. (Bukhari: 1237)"
"634","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mara jabke wo Allah key sath kisi cheez ko shareek karta tha wo aag mein daakhil hoga. Aur main ne kaha: Jo mara jabke wo Allah key sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta tha wo Jannat mein daakhil hoga. (Bukhari: 1238)"
"635","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat (baaton) ka hukm diya aur saat (baaton) se mana kya. Hamein janaazon key peechey chalney, beemaar ki ayaadat, daawat deney waley ki daawat qabool karney, mazloom ki madad, qasam poori karney, salaam ka jawaab deney aur chheenkney waley ko Yarhamukallah kehney ka hukm diya. Aur hamein chaandi key bartanon, soney ki angoothi, resham, deebaaj, qassi aur istabraq se mana kya. (Bukhari: 1239)"
"636","[AI-translation] Umm-ul-Alaa (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Ansaar ki aurat thein jinhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baiat ki thi. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Muhaajireen mein qura andaazi taqseem ki gai. To hamaarey hissey mein Usmaan bin Mazoon aey. To ham ne unhey apne gharon mein utara. To wo us marz mein beemaar huey jis mein wo faut huey. Phir jab wo faut huey aur ghusl diye gaey aur apne kapdon mein kafnaaey gaey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) daakhil huey. To main ne kaha: Tum par Allah ki rehmat ho Abus Saaeb! Tum par meri gawahi hai ke beshak Allah ne tumhey izzat di hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur tumhey kya maloom ke Allah ne usey izzat di hai? To main ne kaha: Merey maan baap Aap par qurbaan Ya Rasulullah! To Allah kisko izzat dega? To Aap ne farmaya: Lekin wo, usey Yaqeen aa gaya hai. Aur Allah ki qasam! Beshak main uskey liye bhalai ki ummeed rakhta hun. Aur Allah ki qasam! Main nahi jaanta jabke main Allah ka Rasool hun ke merey sath kya kya jaaeyga. Unhon-ne kaha: To Allah ki qasam! Main uskey baad kabhi kisi ko paakiza na kahungi. (Bukhari: 1243)"
"637","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab merey waalid qatl kiye gaey to main unkey chehrey se kapda hataata tha aur rota tha. Aur wo mujhey us se mana kartey they. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey mana na kartey they. To meri phuphi Faatima roney lagein. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum roti ho ya nahi roti, farishtey musalsal usey apne paron se saaya kar rahey they yahan tak ke tum ne use uthaaya. (Bukhari: 1244)"
"638","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Najaashi ki khabar di us din jis mein wo faut hua. Aap Eidgaah ki taraf nikley aur unhey saf mein kya aur chaar takbeerein kahein. (Bukhari: 1245)"
"639","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jhanda Zaid ne liya aur wo shaheed huey. Phir use Jafar ne liya aur wo shaheed huey. Phir use Abdullah bin Rawaaha ne liya aur wo shaheed huey, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki donon aankhein beh rahi thein. Phir use Khaalid bin Waleed ne baghair hukm key liya to uskey liye fatah hui. (Bukhari: 1246)"
"640","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmaanon mein se koi Musalman nahi hai jiskey teen (bachchey) faut hon jo balooghat ko na pahunchey hon magar Allah use apne fazl se un par rehem kartey huey Jannat mein daakhil karega. (Bukhari: 1248)"
"641","[AI-translation] Umm Atiya Ansaariya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamaarey paas daakhil huey jab Aapki beti faut huin. To Aap ne farmaya: Use teen ya paanch ya us se zyada martaba ghusl do agar tum aisa dekho, paani aur beri key patton se. Aur aakhir mein kaafoor ya thoda kaafoor rakkho. Phir jab tum faarigh ho jao to mujhey khabar do. Phir jab ham faarigh huin to ham ne Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne hamein apna tehband diya aur farmaya: Use usey pehnaao. Yaani apna tehband. (Bukhari: 1253)"
"642","[AI-translation] Aur aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Uskey daaen hisson aur uskey wuzu key maqaamon se shuru karo. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur ham ne usey teen chotiyaan goondhein."
"643","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko teen safed Yamani Sahooliya qatan key kapdon mein kafnaaya gaya. Un mein na qameez thi aur na amaama. (Bukhari: 1264)"
"644","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke aik aadmi Arafaat mein khada tha ke wo apni sawaari se gira aur usey kuchal diya. Ya farmaya: Us ne use kuchal diya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use paani aur beri key patton se ghusl do aur use do kapdon mein kafnaao. Aur use khushbu na lagao aur uska sar na dhaanpo. Beshak wo Qiyaamat key din talbiya kehta hua uthaaya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 1265)"
"645","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Ubayy jab faut hua to uska beta Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey apni qameez dijiye ke main use us mein kafnaaun aur us par (janaazey ki namaz) padhiye aur uskey liye maghfirat maangiye. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use apni qameez di aur farmaya: Mujhey khabar do ke main us par namaz padhun. To us ne Aap ko khabar di. Phir jab Aap ne us par namaz padhna chaaha to Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Aap ko kheench liya. To us ne kaha: Kya Allah ne tumhey munaafiqon par namaz padhney se nahi roka. To Aap ne farmaya: Main do ikhtiyaaron key darmiyaan hun. Aap ne farmaya: (Tum unkey liye maghfirat maango ya unkey liye maghfirat na maango, agar tum unkey liye sattar martaba maghfirat maango to Allah unhey kabhi na maaf karega). To Aap ne us par namaz padhi aur naazil hui: (Aur un mein se jo mara us mein se kisi par kabhi namaz na padho). (Bukhari: 1269)"
"646","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abdullah bin Ubayy key paas aey uskey dafan honay key baad. To use nikaala aur us mein apne luaab se phoonka aur use apni qameez pehnaai. (Bukhari: 1270)"
"647","[AI-translation] Khabbaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath hijrat ki, Allah ka chehra chaahtey huey. To hamaara ajr Allah par pada. To ham mein se koi mara aur us ne apne ajr mein se kuchh na khaaya. Un mein Musab bin Umair (Raziallahu anhu) they. Aur ham mein se koi hai jiska phal pak gaya hai aur wo use tod raha hai. Wo Uhad key din qatl kiye gaey aur ham ne unhey kafnaaney key liye chaadar key siwa kuchh na paaya. Jab ham us se unka sar dhaanptey to unkey paon nikal aatey aur jab ham unkey paon dhaanptey to unka sar nikal aata. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham unka sar dhaanpein aur unkey pairon par Izkhar mein se rakkhein. (Bukhari: 1276)"
"648","[AI-translation] Sahl (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aurat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas buni hui chaadar ley kar aai jis mein uska haashiya tha. Kya tum jaantey ho Barda kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Shaamla. Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Main ne use apne haath se buna hai aur main aai hun taake tumhey pehnaaun. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use liya jabke Aap ko uski haajat thi. To Aap hamaarey paas nikley jabke wo Aap ka tehband thi. To fulaan ne use achha kaha aur kaha: Mujhey pehnaao, kitni achhi hai! Qaum ne kaha: Tum ne achha na kya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use pehna jabke Aap ko uski haajat thi. Phir tum ne usey maanga jabke tum jaantey they ke wo inkaar nahi kartey. Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main ne usey pehenney key liye nahi maanga. Beshak main ne usey isliye maanga taake wo mera kafan ho. Sahl ne kaha: To wo uska kafan tha. (Bukhari: 1277)"
"649","[AI-translation] Umm Atiya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamein janaazon key peechey chalney se mana kya gaya aur ham par pabandi na ki gai. (Bukhari: 1278)"
"650","[AI-translation] Umm Habeeba (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Us aurat key liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat key din par imaan rakhti hai halaal nahi hai ke wo mayyat par teen (din) se zyada sog manaaey, magar shohar par chaar mahiney das din. (Bukhari: 1281)"
"651","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik aurat key paas se guzrey jo qabr key paas ro rahi thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah se daro aur sabr karo. Us ne kaha: Mujh se door ho, beshak tumhey meri museebat nahi pahunchi. Aur us ne Aap ko na pehchaana. To us se kaha gaya: Beshak wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key darwaazey par aai aur Aap key paas darbaan na paaey. To us ne kaha: Main ne tumhey na pehchaana. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak sabr pehli chot key waqt hai. (Bukhari: 1283)"
"652","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti ne Aapki taraf bheja: Beshak mera beta faut honay wala hai, to hamaarey paas aaeeye. To Aap ne salaam kehtey huey bheja aur farmatey huey: Beshak Allah key liye hai jo us ne liya aur uskey liye hai jo us ne diya. Aur har cheez uskey paas muqarrar muddat key sath hai. To use sabr karna chaahiye aur sawaab samajhna chaahiye. To us ne Aapki taraf bheja aur Aap par qasam di ke Aap zaroor uskey paas aaeengey. To Aap uthay jabke Aap key sath Saad bin Ubada aur Muaz bin Jabal aur Ubayy bin Kaab aur Zaid bin Saabit aur aadmi they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf bachcha uthaaya gaya jabke uski jaan ukhad rahi thi goya mashkiza hai. To Aapki donon aankhein behnein lagein. To Saad ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye kya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Ye rehmat hai jo Allah ne apne bandon key dilon mein rakhi hai. Aur beshak Allah apne bandon mein se rehem karney walon par rehem karta hai. (Bukhari: 1284)"
"653","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti (key janaazey) mein haazir huey. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qabr par baithey they. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne Aapki donon aankhein behtey huey dekhein. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi aadmi hai jo raat ko (biwi se) na mila ho? To Abu Talha ne kaha: Main. Aap ne farmaya: To utro. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo uski qabr mein utrey. (Bukhari: 1285)"
"654","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mayyat ko uskey ghar walon key baaz roney se azaab diya jaata hai. To wo Aisha (Raziallahu anha) ko pahuncha Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki maut key baad. To unhon-ne kaha: Allah Umar par rehem farmaaey. Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hadees bayan nahi ki: Beshak momin ko uskey ghar walon key roney se azaab diya jaata hai. Lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah kaafir ko uskey ghar walon key roney se azaab badhaa deta hai. Aur unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey Quran kaafi hai (Aur koi bojh uthaaney wala kisi doosrey ka bojh nahi uthaaeyga). (Bukhari: 1288)"
"655","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Yahoodi aurat key paas se guzrey jis par uskey ghar waley ro rahey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo us par ro rahey hain aur beshak use uski qabr mein azaab diya jaa raha hai. (Bukhari: 1289)"
"656","[AI-translation] Mugheera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak mujh par jhoot (baandhna) kisi par jhoot (baandhney) jaisa nahi hai. Jo mujh par jaan boojh kar jhoot baandhey to wo aag mein apna thikaana bana ley. Aur main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jis par noha kya jaey use us nohey se azaab diya jaata hai. (Bukhari: 1291)"
"657","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham mein se nahi hai jo gaalon par maarey aur girebaan phaadey aur jaahiliyat ki pukaar pukaarey. (Bukhari: 1294)"
"658","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqaas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hajjat-ul-Wada key saal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sakht dard se meri ayaadat kartey they jo mujhey tha. To main ne kaha: Beshak mujhey dard ne pahuncha hai jo tum dekhtey ho. Aur main maal wala hun aur meri beti key siwa koi waaris nahi hai. To kya main apne maal mein se do tihaai sadqa kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. To main ne kaha: Aadhey se? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Phir farmaya: Tihaai se, aur tihaai bada ya bahut hai. Beshak tum apne waarison ko maaldaar chhoro ye behtar hai is se ke tum unhey mohtaaj chhoro jo logon se maangtey phirein. Aur beshak tum jo kharch karogey jis se Allah ka chehra chaahtey ho magar us par tumhey ajr diya jaaeyga, yahan tak ke jo tum apni biwi key munh mein rakhtey ho. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main apne sahaaba key baad chhoda jaaunga? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum peechey na chhorey jaaogey aur nek amal karogey magar us se darja aur bulandi mein badhogey. Phir shayed tum peechey chhorey jao yahan tak ke tum se qaumein faeda uthaein aur doosri tum se nuqsaan uthaein. Ae Allah! Merey sahaaba ki hijrat poori farma aur unhey unki aidiyon par wapas na kar. Lekin bechaara Saad bin Khaula! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us par rehem farmatey hain ke wo Makkah mein faut hua. (Bukhari: 1295)"
"659","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo sakht dard mein beemaar huey aur behosh ho gaey jabke unka sar unkey ghar ki aik aurat ki god mein tha. To wo roi aur wo usey kuchh jawaab na dey sakey. Phir jab hosh mein aey to kaha: Main us se bari hun jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bari huey. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) cheekhney wali aur (gham mein) sar mundwaanay wali aur (kapdey) phaadney wali se bari huey. (Bukhari: 1296)"
"660","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas Ibn Haaritha aur Jafar aur Ibn Rawaaha key qatl ki khabar aai to Aap baithey jabke Aap mein gham pehchaana jaata tha. Aur main darwaazey key shaq se dekh rahi thi, darwaazey key shaq se. To Aap key paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak Jafar ki auratein, aur unkey roney ka zikr kya. To Aap ne use hukm diya ke unhey mana karey. To wo gaya phir doosri martaba Aap key paas aaya. To us ne Aap ko khabar di ke unhon-ne uski baat na maani. To Aap ne farmaya: Unhey mana karo. To wo teesri martaba Aap key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak unhon-ne ham par ghalba paa liya hai Ya Rasulullah! To unhon-ne zikr kya ke Aap ne farmaya: Unkey munhon mein mitti daalo. (Bukhari: 1299)"
"661","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ka beta faut ho gaya jabke Abu Talha baahar they. Phir jab uski biwi ne dekha ke wo faut ho gaya hai to us ne kuchh tayyaar kya aur use ghar key pehlu mein rakkha. Phir jab Abu Talha aey to unhon-ne kaha: Ladka kaisa hai? Us ne kaha: Uski jaan sukoon mein aa gai hai. Aur mujhey ummeed hai ke wo aaraam mein ho gaya hai. Aur Abu Talha ne gumaan kya ke wo sachchi hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo raat rahey. Phir jab subah hui to ghusl kya. Phir jab nikalna chaaha to us ne use khabar di ke wo faut ho gaya hai. To us ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath namaz padhi, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko un donon key maamley ki khabar di jo un se hua tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shayad Allah tum donon key liye tumhaari raat mein barkat dey. Ansaar mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: To main ne un donon key nau ladkey dekhey, wo sab Quran padh chukey they. (Bukhari: 1301)"
"662","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Abu Saif lohaar key paas daakhil huey. Aur wo Ibrahim key doodh shareek baap they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ibrahim ko liya aur usey bosa diya aur soongha. Phir ham uskey paas uskey baad daakhil huey jabke Ibrahim jaan dey rahey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki donon aankhein behnein lagein. To Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne Aap se kaha: Aur Aap Ya Rasulullah? To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Auf! Beshak ye rehmat hai. Phir uskey peechey doosri (aansu) laaey aur farmaya: Beshak aankh aanso bahaati hai aur dil gham karta hai. Aur ham sirf wahi kehtey hain jo hamaarey Rab ko raazi karey. Aur beshak ham tumhaari judai se ae Ibrahim ghamgeen hain. (Bukhari: 1303)"
"663","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Saad bin Ubada beemaar huey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki ayaadat key liye tashreef laaey Abdur Rahman bin Auf aur Saad bin Abi Waqqaas aur Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhum) key sath. Phir jab Aap unkey paas daakhil huey to unhey unkey ghar walon key gherey mein paaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya wo faut ho gaey? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi Ya Rasulullah! To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) roey. Phir jab qaum ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka rona dekha to wo roey. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum nahi suntey? Beshak Allah aankh key aanso se aur dil key gham se azaab nahi deta. Lekin is se azaab deta hai, aur Aap ne apni zabaan ki taraf ishaara kya, ya rehem karta hai. Aur beshak mayyat ko uskey ghar walon key roney se azaab diya jaata hai. (Bukhari: 1304)"
"664","[AI-translation] Umm Atiya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baiat key waqt ham se ahd liya ke ham noha na karengey. To ham mein se paanch auraton key siwa kisi aurat ne poora na kya: Umm Sulaim aur Umm-ul-Alaa aur Abu Sabra ki beti jo Muaz ki biwi hain aur do auratein. Ya Abu Sabra ki beti aur Muaz ki biwi aur aik doosri aurat. (Bukhari: 1306)"
"665","[AI-translation] Aamir bin Rabeea (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi janaaza dekhey to agar wo uskey sath chalne wala na ho to khada ho jaey yahan tak ke wo usey peechey chhor dey ya wo use peechey chhor dey ya wo rakh diya jaey us se pehley ke wo use peechey chhor dey. (Bukhari: 1308)"
"666","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Marwaan ka haath pakda jabke wo donon janaazey mein they. To wo rakhay jaaney se pehley baithey. To Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) aey aur unhon-ne Marwaan ka haath pakda aur kaha: Utho. To Allah ki qasam! Beshak ye jaan chuka hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein us se mana kya hai. To Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha. (Bukhari: 1309)"
"667","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamaarey paas se janaaza guzra. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uskey liye khadey huey aur ham Aap key sath khadey huey. To ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak wo Yahoodi ka janaaza hai. Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum janaaza dekho to khadey ho jao. (Bukhari: 1311). Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Sahl bin Hunaif aur Qais bin Saad Qaadisiya mein baithey they. To un donon key paas se janaaza guzaara gaya aur wo donon khadey ho gaey. To un donon se kaha gaya ke wo zameen walon mein se hai, yaani zimmi walon mein se. To un donon ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas se janaaza guzra aur Aap khadey huey. To Aap se kaha gaya: Beshak wo Yahoodi ka janaaza hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya wo jaan nahi hai. (1312). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"668","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab janaaza rakkha jaey aur aadmi use apni gardano par uthaein. Phir agar wo nek hai to kehta hai: Mujhey aagey karo. Aur agar wo nek nahi hai to kehta hai: Haey us par afsos! Use kahaan ley jaa rahey ho. Uski aawaaz har cheez sunti hai magar insaan. Aur agar wo sunta to behosh ho jaata. (Bukhari: 1314)"
"669","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Janaazey mein jaldi karo. Phir agar wo nek hai to bhalai hai jiski taraf tum use aagey kartey ho. Aur agar uskey siwa hai to buraai hai jisey tum apni gardano se utaartey ho. (Bukhari: 1315). Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aaj Habsha mein aik nek aadmi faut hua hai. To aao aur us par namaz padho. Unhon-ne kaha: To ham ne saf baandhi aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us par namaz padhi jabke ham Aap key sath safon mein they. Abu Zubair ne kaha: Jaabir se: Main doosri saf mein tha. (1320). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Apne bhai key liye maghfirat maango. (1327). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"670","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Beshak Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain: Jo janaazey key peechey chaley to uskey liye qeeraat hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ne ham par bahut kya. To Aisha ne Abu Hurairah ki tasdeeq ki aur kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko use kehtey huey suna hai. To Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Beshak ham ne bahut qeeraat zaaya kiye hain. (Bukhari: 1323, 1324)"
"671","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne apne us marz mein farmaya jis mein Aap faut huey: Yahood aur Nasaara par Allah ki laanat ho, unhon-ne apne Nabiyon ki qabron ko masjidein bana liya. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur agar wo na hota to uski qabr zaahir kar di jaati, magar mujhey khauf hai ke use masjid bana liya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 1330)"
"672","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey us aurat par namaz padhi jo nifaas mein faut hui. To Aap uskey darmiyaan mein khadey huey. (Bukhari: 1331)"
"673","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne janaazey par namaz padhi aur Surah Faatiha padhi. Unhon-ne kaha: Taake wo jaan lein ke wo sunnat hai. (Bukhari: 1335)"
"674","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Banda jab apni qabr mein rakkha jaata hai aur us se munh mod liya jaata hai aur uskey saathi jaatey hain yahan tak ke beshak wo unkey jooton ki aawaaz sunta hai. Uskey paas do farishtey aatey hain aur use bithaatey hain. To us se kehtey hain: Tum is aadmi Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baarey mein kya kehtey they? To wo kehta hai: Main gawahi deta hun ke wo Allah key bandey aur uskey Rasool hain. To kaha jaata hai: Aag mein apne thikaaney ki taraf dekho, Allah ne uskey badley tumhey Jannat mein thikaana dey diya hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To wo donon ko dekhta hai. Aur kaafir ya munaafiq to kehta hai: Main nahi jaanta, main wahi kehta tha jo log kehtey they. To kaha jaata hai: Tum ne jaana aur na padha. Phir lohey key hathodey se uskey donon kaanon key darmiyaan maar maari jaati hai. To wo cheekh maar key cheekhta hai jisey uskey qareeb waley suntey hain magar jinn aur insaan. (Bukhari: 1338)"
"675","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Maut ka farishta Musa (Alaihissalam) ki taraf bheja gaya. Phir jab wo unkey paas aaya to unhon-ne use thappad maara. To wo apne Rab ki taraf wapas gaya aur kaha: Tune mujhey aisey bandey ki taraf bheja hai jo maut nahi chaahta. To Allah ne uski aankh usey wapas kar di aur farmaya: Wapas jao. To us se kaho ke wo apna haath bail ki peeth par rakkhey. To usey har us baal key badley jisey uska haath dhaanpey, har baal key badley saal milega. Us ne kaha: Ae merey Rab! Phir kya? Us ne farmaya: Phir maut. Us ne kaha: To abhi. To us ne Allah se maanga ke wo usey Muqaddas Zameen se patthar phenkney ki doori par kar dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir agar main wahaan hota to tumhey uski qabr raastey key pehlu mein surkh teelay key paas dikhaata. (Bukhari: 1339)"
"676","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Uhad key shaheedon mein se do aadmiyon ko aik kapdey mein jama kartey, phir farmatey: Un mein Quran zyada lenay wala kaun hai? Phir jab un mein se aik ki taraf ishaara kya jaata to use lahd mein aagey kartey aur farmatey: Main Qiyaamat key din un par gawaah hun. Aur unhey unkey khoon mein dafan karney ka hukm diya aur unhey ghusl na diya gaya aur na un par (janaazey ki namaz) padhi gai. (Bukhari: 1343)"
"677","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din nikley aur Uhad walon par mayyat ki namaz jaisi namaz padhi, phir mimbar ki taraf wapas aey aur farmaya: Beshak main tumharey liye aagey jaaney wala hun aur main tum par gawaah hun. Aur beshak main Allah ki qasam abhi apne hauz ki taraf dekh raha hun. Aur beshak mujhey zameen key khazaanon ki chaabiyaan di gaein hain ya zameen ki chaabiyaan. Aur beshak main Allah ki qasam tum par nahi darta ke tum merey baad shirk karogey. Lekin tum par darta hun ke tum us mein aik doosrey se aagey badhogey. (Bukhari: 1344)"
"678","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath aik giroh mein Ibn Sayyaad ki taraf nikley. Yahan tak ke unhey paaya jabke wo Bani Mughaala key qilon key paas bachchon key sath khel raha tha jabke Ibn Sayyaad balooghat key qareeb tha. To usey khabar na hui yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne haath se maara. Phir Ibn Sayyaad se farmaya: Kya tum gawahi detey ho ke main Allah ka Rasool hun? To Ibn Sayyaad ne uski taraf dekha aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke tum Ummiyon key Rasool ho. Phir Ibn Sayyaad ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Kya tum gawahi detey ho ke main Allah ka Rasool hun? To Aap ne use rad kar diya aur farmaya: Main Allah aur uskey Rasoolon par imaan laaya. To us se farmaya: Tum kya dekhtey ho? Ibn Sayyaad ne kaha: Merey paas sachcha aur jhootha aata hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par maamla gadmad kar diya gaya hai. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Beshak main ne tumharey liye chhupaai hui cheez chhupaai hai. To Ibn Sayyaad ne kaha: Wo Dukh hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Door ho! Tum apni qadr se aagey na badhogey. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Mujhey chhoro Ya Rasulullah ke main uski gardan maar dun. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar wo wahi hai to tum us par qaabu na paaogey. Aur agar wo wahi nahi hai to usey qatl karney mein tumharey liye koi bhalai nahi hai. Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Phir uskey baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Ubayy bin Kaab un khajooron ki taraf chaley jin mein Ibn Sayyaad tha jabke wo chhup kar Ibn Sayyaad se kuchh sun-na chaaahtey they us se pehley ke Ibn Sayyaad unhey dekhey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use dekha jabke wo leta hua tha, yaani apni qateefa mein jis mein gungunaahat ya aawaaz thi. To Ibn Sayyaad ki maan ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha jabke Aap khajoor key tanon se bach rahey they. To us ne Ibn Sayyaad se kaha: Ae Saaf! Aur wo Ibn Sayyaad ka naam hai. Ye Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. To Ibn Sayyaad uth khada hua. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar wo use chhorey rakhti to wo waazeh kar deta. (Bukhari: 1354, 1355)"
"679","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik Yahoodi ladka Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat karta tha. To wo beemaar hua. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski ayaadat key liye tashreef laaey aur uskey sar key paas baithey aur us se farmaya: Musalman ho jao. To us ne apne baap ki taraf dekha jabke wo uskey paas tha. To us ne us se kaha: Abul Qaasim ki baat maano. To wo Musalman ho gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley jabke farma rahey they: Tamaam tareefein Allah key liye jis ne use aag se najaat di. (Bukhari: 1356)"
"680","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi bachcha paida nahi hota magar fitrat par paida hota hai. To uskey maan baap use Yahoodi banaatey hain aur Nasraani banaatey hain ya Majoosi banaatey hain. Jaisey jaanwar poora jaanwar janta hai. Kya tum us mein kaana (nazar aata hai). Phir Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain: (Allah ki fitrat jis par us ne logon ko paida kya hai. Allah ki paidaish mein tabdeeli nahi hai. Yehi seedha deen hai). (Bukhari: 1359)"
"681","[AI-translation] Musayyab bin Hazn (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Abu Taalib ki maut ka waqt aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uskey paas aey. To uskey paas Abu Jahl bin Hishaam aur Abdullah bin Abi Umayya bin Mugheera ko paaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Taalib se kaha: Ae merey chacha! La ilaaha illallah kaho, aisa kalimat jiskey sath main Allah key paas tumharey liye gawahi dun. To Abu Jahl aur Abdullah bin Abi Umayya ne kaha: Ae Abu Taalib! Kya tum Abdul Muttalib ki millat se munh modtey ho? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) use us par pesh kartey rahey aur wo donon us baat ko dohraatey rahey yahan tak ke Abu Taalib ne aakhir jo un se kaha kaha: Wo Abdul Muttalib ki millat par hai. Aur us ne La ilaaha illallah kehney se inkaar kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor tumharey liye maghfirat maangunga jab tak mujhey tum se mana na kya jaey. To Allah Taala ne uskey baarey mein naazil farmaya: (Nabi key liye na tha) aayat. (Bukhari: 1360)"
"682","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Baqee-ul-Gharqad mein janaazey mein they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamaarey paas aey aur baithey aur ham Aap key gird baithey jabke Aap key paas chhadi thi. To Aap ne (sar) jhukaaya aur apni chhadi se khodney lagey. Phir farmaya: Tum mein se koi nahi hai, koi jaandaar jaan nahi hai, magar uski Jannat aur aag mein jagah likh di gai hai. Aur magar likh diya gaya hai: Badnaseeb ya khushnaseeb. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham apne likhey par bharosa na karein aur amal chhor dein. Phir jo ham mein khushnaseebon mein se hoga wo khushnaseebon key amal ki taraf hoga. Aur jo ham mein badnaseebon mein se hoga wo badnaseebon key amal ki taraf hoga. Aap ne farmaya: Khushnaseeb to unkey liye khushnaseebi key amal aasaan kar diye jaaengey. Aur badnaseeb to unkey liye badnaseebi key amal aasaan kar diye jaaengey. Phir tilaawat ki: (Phir jis ne diya aur dara aur achhi baat ki tasdeeq ki) aayat. (Bukhari: 1362)"
"683","[AI-translation] Saabit bin Zahhaak (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo Islam key siwa kisi millat ki jhoothi jaan boojh kar qasam khaey to wo jaisa us ne kaha waisa hai. Aur jo apne aap ko lohey se qatl karey to use Jahannum ki aag mein us se azaab diya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 1363)"
"684","[AI-translation] Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aik aadmi ko zakhm they to us ne apne aap ko qatl kar liya. To Allah ne farmaya: Merey bandey ne apni jaan key sath mujh se jaldi ki. Main ne us par Jannat haraam kar di. (Bukhari: 1364)"
"685","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apna gala ghontey wo aag mein apna gala ghontega. Aur jo use (hathiyaar) maarey wo aag mein use maarega. (Bukhari: 1365)"
"686","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Wo janaazey key paas se guzrey aur uski achhi tareef ki. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Waajib ho gai. Phir doosrey key paas se guzrey aur uski buri tareef ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Waajib ho gai. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Kya waajib hui? Aap ne farmaya: Iski tum ne achhi tareef ki to uskey liye Jannat waajib ho gai. Aur iski tum ne buri tareef ki to uskey liye aag waajib ho gai. Tum zameen mein Allah key gawaah ho. (Bukhari: 1367)"
"687","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman ho jiskey liye chaar bhalai ki gawahi dein to Allah use Jannat mein daakhil karega. To ham ne kaha: Aur teen? Aap ne farmaya: Aur teen. To ham ne kaha: Aur do? Aap ne farmaya: Aur do. Phir ham ne Aap se aik key baarey mein na poochha. (Bukhari: 1368)"
"688","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab momin ko uski qabr mein bithaaya jaey to wo aata hai. Phir gawahi deta hai ke La ilaaha illallah aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. To wo uska qaul hai: (Allah imaan walon ko pakki baat key sath saabit rakhta hai). (Bukhari: 1369)"
"689","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kuwein walon par zaahir huey aur farmaya: Tum ne jo tumharey Rab ne waada kya tha sach paaya? To Aap se kaha gaya: Tum murdon ko pukaartey ho? To Aap ne farmaya: Tum un se zyada sun-ney waley nahi ho, lekin wo jawaab nahi detey. (Bukhari: 1370)"
"690","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak wo ab jaantey hain ke jo main kehta tha haq hai. Aur beshak Allah Taala ne farmaya: (Beshak tum murdon ko nahi sunaatey). (Bukhari: 1371)"
"691","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khateeb ho kar khadey huey aur qabr key fitney ka zikr kya jis mein aadmi aazmaaya jaata hai. Phir jab Aap ne uska zikr kya to Musalman cheekh maar kar roey. (Bukhari: 1373)"
"692","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley jabke sooraj ghurub ho chuka tha. To Aap ne aawaaz suni aur farmaya: Yahood apni qabron mein azaab diye jaa rahey hain. (Bukhari: 1375)"
"693","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dua kartey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main qabr key azaab se aur aag key azaab se aur zindagi aur maut key fitney se aur Maseeh Dajjaal key fitney se teri panaah maangta hun. (Bukhari: 1377)"
"694","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se koi jab marta hai to us par uska thikaana subah aur shaam pesh kya jaata hai. Agar wo Jannat walon mein se hai to Jannat walon mein se. Aur agar wo aag walon mein se hai to aag walon mein se. To kaha jaata hai: Ye tumhara thikaana hai yahan tak ke Allah tumhey Qiyaamat key din uthaaey. (Bukhari: 1379)"
"695","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) faut huey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak uskey liye Jannat mein doodh pilaanay wali hai. (Bukhari: 1382)"
"696","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mushrikeen ki aulaad key baarey mein poochha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah jab unhey paida kya to zyada jaanta tha ke wo kya karney waley they. (Bukhari: 1383)"
"697","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab namaz padhtey to apne chehrey key sath hamaari taraf mutawajjeh hotey aur farmatey: Tum mein se kis ne aaj raat khwaab dekha? Unhon-ne kaha: Phir agar koi dekhta to bayan karta aur Aap jo Allah chaahta kehtey. To Aap ne ham se aik din poochha aur farmaya: Kya tum mein se kisi ne khwaab dekha? Ham ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Lekin main ne aaj raat dekha ke do aadmi merey paas aey aur unhon-ne mera haath pakad liya aur mujhey Muqaddas Zameen ki taraf nikaal ley gaey. Phir aik aadmi baitha hua tha aur aik aadmi khada tha jiskey haath mein lohey ka aankda tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak wo us aankdey ko uskey jabdey mein daakhil karta yahan tak ke uski gudi tak pahunchaata, phir uskey doosrey jabdey key sath aisa karta. Aur uska ye jabda mil jaata. To wo wapas aata aur aisa karta. Main ne kaha: Ye kya hai? Un donon ne kaha: Chalo. To ham chaley yahan tak ke aik aadmi par aey jo apni peeth par leta hua tha aur aik aadmi uskey sar par pathar ya chattaan ley kar khada tha. To wo us se uska sar phodta. Phir jab wo use maarta to pathar ludhak jaata. To wo use lenay key liye uski taraf jaata. To wo iski taraf wapas na aata yahan tak ke uska sar mil jaata aur uska sar jaisa tha waisa ho jaata. To wo uski taraf wapas aata aur use maarta. Main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Un donon ne kaha: Chalo. To ham suraakh ki taraf chaley jo tandoor jaisa tha. Uska upar tang aur neechey kushaada tha. Uskey neechey aag jal rahi thi. Phir jab qareeb aatey to uthtey yahan tak ke qareeb hota ke wo nikal jaaein. Phir jab thandi hoti to us mein wapas aatey. Aur us mein mard aur nangey auratein they. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hain? Un donon ne kaha: Chalo. To ham chaley yahan tak ke khoon ki nehar par aey jis mein aik aadmi nehar key darmiyaan mein khada tha. Aur nehar key kinaarey par aik aadmi tha jiskey saamney patthar they. To wo aadmi jo nehar mein tha aagey badha. Phir jab wo nikalna chaahta to aadmi uskey munh mein patthar maarta aur use wahaan wapas kar deta jahaan wo tha. To jab bhi wo nikalney key liye aata to uskey munh mein patthar maarta aur wo waisa wapas aata jaisa tha. To main ne kaha: Ye kya hai? Un donon ne kaha: Chalo. To ham chaley yahan tak ke sabz baagh tak pahunchey jis mein bada darkht tha aur uski jad mein budha aur bachchey they. Aur aik aadmi darkht key qareeb tha jiskey saamney aag thi jisey wo jala raha tha. To wo donon mujhey darkht mein chadhaa kar ley gaey aur mujhey ghar mein daakhil kya jo main ne kabhi us se zyada achha nahi dekha. Us mein budhey mard aur jawan aur auratein aur bachchey they. Phir unhon-ne mujhey us se nikaala. To wo donon mujhey darkht par chadhaa kar ley gaey aur mujhey ghar mein daakhil kya jo zyada achha aur afzal hai, us mein budhey aur jawan hain. Main ne kaha: Tum ne mujhey aaj raat ghumaaya hai. To mujhey jo main ne dekha uskey baarey mein batao. Un donon ne kaha: Haan. Lekin jo tum ne dekha ke uska jabda phaada jaa raha tha to wo jhootha hai jo jhoot bayan karta hai aur us se uthaaya jaata hai yahan tak ke ufaq tak pahunchta hai. To uskey sath Qiyaamat key din tak aisa kya jaaeyga. Aur jo tum ne dekha ke uska sar phoda jaa raha tha to wo aadmi hai jisey Allah ne Quran sikhaaya aur wo raat ko us se sota raha aur din mein us par amal na kya. Uskey sath Qiyaamat key din tak aisa kya jaaeyga. Aur jo tum ne suraakh mein dekhey to wo zinaakaar hain. Aur jo tum ne nehar mein dekha to wo sood khaanay waley hain. Aur darkht ki jad mein budha Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) hain. Aur uskey gird bachchey to logon ki aulaad hain. Aur jo aag jala raha hai wo Maalik hai jo aag ka daarogha hai. Aur pehla ghar jis mein tum daakhil huey aam mominon ka ghar hai. Aur ye ghar shaheedon ka ghar hai. Aur main Jibreel hun aur ye Mikaael hain. To apna sar uthao. To main ne apna sar uthaaya. Phir merey upar baadal jaisa tha. Un donon ne kaha: Wo tumhaara thikaana hai. Main ne kaha: Mujhey chhoro ke main apne thikaaney mein daakhil hun. Un donon ne kaha: Beshak tumhaari umr baaqi hai jo tum ne poori nahi ki. Phir agar tum poori kar letey to apne thikaaney mein aatey. (Bukhari: 1386)"
"698","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Beshak meri maan achaanak faut ho gai hain. Aur mera khayaal hai ke agar wo bolteen to sadqa karteen. To kya usey ajr hai agar main uski taraf se sadqa karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. (Bukhari: 1388)"
"699","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne marz mein uzr kartey they: Main aaj kahaan hun? Main kal kahaan hun? Aisha key din ki jaldi mein. Phir jab mera din tha to Allah ne Aap ko merey seeney aur halq key darmiyaan faut kya. Aur Aap merey ghar mein dafan huey. (Bukhari: 1389)"
"700","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut huey jabke Aap in chhe aadmiyon se raazi they. To unhon-ne chhe key naam liye. To Usmaan aur Ali aur Talha aur Zubair aur Abdur Rahman bin Auf aur Saad bin Abi Waqqaas key naam liye. (Bukhari: 1392)"
"701","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Murdon ko bura na kaho, beshak wo uski taraf pahunch gaey hain jo unhon-ne aagey bheja tha. (Bukhari: 1393). Kitaab-uz-Zakaat."
